forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louisiana_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Louisiana MathCounts (page does not exist)\">Louisiana MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ala-La-Miss_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Louisiana_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Louisiana high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louisiana_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Louisiana high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/community/c4_high_school_math\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ala-La-Miss_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Louisiana_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul